/dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/16/9e/5e/15/20190228-141720-largejpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/16/9e/5e/16/20190228-123103-largejpg.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2019-03-01", "published_at_date": "2019-03-01"}, {"review_id": 655449341, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r655449341-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Interesting visit to a famous Hindu temple", "text": "Very bustling with many worshipers. A unique visit, especially with many cremations going on (where the body, ashes and wood are then dumped into the holy river), something you won't see in most countries. Do note that foreigners/non-hindus are not allowed to enter the main temple, but there's plenty to see outside the main hall of worship.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2019-02-28"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "C3941F051EBECDB5EED90C0DAE870BCA", "name": "erssrkj", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/erssrkj", "username": "erssrkj", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e3/1f/default-avatar-2020-46.jpg", "contribution_count": 52, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-02-28", "published_at_date": "2019-02-28"}, {"review_id": 655007226, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r655007226-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Great insight into Hindu ritual", "text": "Amazing opportunity to see Hindu rituals in many forms. Not for all, as you may see people who are being cremated, and that can be disturbing to some. I found it an adventure into something the west doesn't have.", "review_tip": null, "r